    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For your consideration - a precision game on rails that brings arcade action into the modern era. Mix <strong>bullet hell</strong>, <strong>dodge 'em up</strong>, and <strong>slippery physics</strong>, and you get a brand new challenge that is as simple as it is difficult. Easy to learn - hold the button to go forward, let go to drift backward - and tough as nails to complete. Face a relentless barrage of endless combinations of attacks, every level being like sneaking through a machine <strong>designed to grind you into a pulp</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/2762c12ab462d0e696a95d2fb5f101aa.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/2762c12ab462d0e696a95d2fb5f101aa.webm?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/2762c12ab462d0e696a95d2fb5f101aa.mp4?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now there's an even better Cakefoot, featuring 30+ achievements, new visuals, expanded soundtrack, and detailed stats. Zig and zag your way through four chapters of <strong>non-stop action</strong>, <strong>lightning</strong> <strong>quick respawn</strong>, and <strong>compelling level design</strong> that keeps you insisting on just one last try! And don't forget arcade mode - get as far as you can before time expires, and submit your name to the scoreboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/8ec4dce9ac2f90cdf8a25e8c2cc35611.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/8ec4dce9ac2f90cdf8a25e8c2cc35611.webm?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/8ec4dce9ac2f90cdf8a25e8c2cc35611.mp4?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAKE is just the beginning -- beat the game and collect all the coins to unlock BEEF CAKE, BUFFALO BEEF CAKE, and even visual effects, MIRROR and WARPED. Cakefoot is the perfect companion to <strong>relentless gaming</strong>! Sally forth today \ud83d\udc34</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/169a49d17a91850c17928fe5fc03d192.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/169a49d17a91850c17928fe5fc03d192.webm?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/169a49d17a91850c17928fe5fc03d192.mp4?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Cakefoot Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 22-level Quest Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arcade mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ achievements and detailed stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Modular enemy types that combine into endless patterns </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-save</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new difficulties, character skin, and visual effects by collecting challenge coins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Runs on Windows, Mac, Linux at 60 FPS in any resolution </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports mouse, keyboard, and gamepad </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can run fullscreen, and can be displayed on any monitor in a multi-monitor setup </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamically resize the window to any dimension </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple JSON syntax for creating and sharing new levels and reskins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Modifiable source code</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/1500a990b036de6507b7f3cdc4b0c487.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/1500a990b036de6507b7f3cdc4b0c487.apng?t=1748476828\" class=\"bb_img\" width=20 height=20 /></picture></span> \u2728</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For your consideration - a precision game on rails that brings arcade action into the modern era. Mix <strong>bullet hell</strong>, <strong>dodge 'em up</strong>, and <strong>slippery physics</strong>, and you get a brand new challenge that is as simple as it is difficult. Easy to learn - hold the button to go forward, let go to drift backward - and tough as nails to complete. Face a relentless barrage of endless combinations of attacks, every level being like sneaking through a machine <strong>designed to grind you into a pulp</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/2762c12ab462d0e696a95d2fb5f101aa.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/2762c12ab462d0e696a95d2fb5f101aa.webm?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/2762c12ab462d0e696a95d2fb5f101aa.mp4?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now there's an even better Cakefoot, featuring 30+ achievements, new visuals, expanded soundtrack, and detailed stats. Zig and zag your way through four chapters of <strong>non-stop action</strong>, <strong>lightning</strong> <strong>quick respawn</strong>, and <strong>compelling level design</strong> that keeps you insisting on just one last try! And don't forget arcade mode - get as far as you can before time expires, and submit your name to the scoreboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/8ec4dce9ac2f90cdf8a25e8c2cc35611.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/8ec4dce9ac2f90cdf8a25e8c2cc35611.webm?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/8ec4dce9ac2f90cdf8a25e8c2cc35611.mp4?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAKE is just the beginning -- beat the game and collect all the coins to unlock BEEF CAKE, BUFFALO BEEF CAKE, and even visual effects, MIRROR and WARPED. Cakefoot is the perfect companion to <strong>relentless gaming</strong>! Sally forth today \ud83d\udc34</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/169a49d17a91850c17928fe5fc03d192.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/169a49d17a91850c17928fe5fc03d192.webm?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/169a49d17a91850c17928fe5fc03d192.mp4?t=1748476828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Cakefoot Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 22-level Quest Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arcade mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ achievements and detailed stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Modular enemy types that combine into endless patterns </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-save</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new difficulties, character skin, and visual effects by collecting challenge coins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Runs on Windows, Mac, Linux at 60 FPS in any resolution </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Supports mouse, keyboard, and gamepad </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can run fullscreen, and can be displayed on any monitor in a multi-monitor setup </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamically resize the window to any dimension </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple JSON syntax for creating and sharing new levels and reskins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Modifiable source code</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/1500a990b036de6507b7f3cdc4b0c487.poster.avif?t=1748476828\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869020/extras/1500a990b036de6507b7f3cdc4b0c487.apng?t=1748476828\" class=\"bb_img\" width=20 height=20 /></picture></span> \u2728</p>",
    "short_description": "Fork it up! Cakefoot is a challenging, single-button dodge \u2019em up on rails. Pilot a walking cake \u2013 hold to accelerate, let go to drift back \u2013 and survive against all odds. Featuring 22 epic levels, arcade mode, unlockables, and high scores, Cakefoot is endlessly replayable, and impossible to defeat.",
